# Extracted animation strips: build output, regenerated by
# bound-fullbleed/tools/poc_jus/autocut.py from the sheet beside them.
# Tracked as 3680 PNGs they would bloat every clone of this data repo and churn
# on every detector change; the sheets ARE tracked, so the output is
# reproducible from them.
#
# Two levels, not one: the path is <Series>/<slug>/split/, so */split/ matches
# nothing and silently fails to protect anything.
*/*/split/
